H_004 - People with sufficient mental capacity with a little effort could analyze what I wrote and find &ldquo;gaps&rdquo; that they can use to &ldquo;break&rdquo; or &ldquo;deny&rdquo; what I expose. As I have already written, these are synthetic elements with educational purposes, and I do not like this being done in my absence given that in any case I have chosen to be synthetic and not to make treatises. There are always special cases, and what I am stating anyway is simply &ldquo;my understanding nowadays&rdquo;. It is not a given that in 10 years this stuff will not be largely deprecated because we will have further and better insights or revolutions on certain topics (by hypothesis) or that a particular book exposes some of these issues in a broader and more detailed way. It is not even a given that, in the event of nefarious behavior by the community, that what has been exposed will be considered pure fiction.